# Project Management SaaS Architecture & Cursor Rules

## Stack & Principles
- Next.js 15 App Router, TypeScript (Strict Mode), Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons, Framer Motion, Recharts.
- PostgreSQL Prisma ORM relational modeling for Workspaces, Projects, Sprints, Issues, Users, and ActivityLogs.
- Real-time Multi-tenant Kanban and Sprint Burndown calculations with interactive velocity estimators.
- Responsive UX across mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports.
- Web Analytics integrated via @vercel/analytics and @vercel/speed-insights.
